    "Nansen was not connected. smartWalletCount and kolCount are null so the UI shows an em dash; never write 0 to mean missing.",
    "Ages on smartFlows are as last read during the scroll capture; the same wallet+action+token+usd row can show a drifted age on later passes, so ages are approximate. A Paused indicator appeared on the 1h Smart Inflow board; it was not used as a reason to drop rows. Screenshots: trending.png and token-info-crop.png (Solana 1h Trending table ~8:22 AM ET), inflow.png through inflow-6.png (Smart Inflow scroll passes).",
    "Trending top 10 and Token Info percentages were taken from a signed-in GMGN Solana 1h Trending table at https://gmgn.ai/trend?chain=sol (Trending tab, 1h, confirmed selected in trending.png) around 8:22 AM ET and checked against trending.png. price was not shown on the table (stored null). Token Info icons, confirmed on the screenshot: green-person % = top10Pct, red-rat/stack % = insiderPct (4th chip on line 1), green-sniper/target % = sniperPct (last percentage chip on line 2, before Unpaid/CTO). Visible 0% values are stored as 0. Other Token Info chips (DS, lock, bundler/bot %, Unpaid, CTO, tax) are not in this schema and were not stored as risk flags; no honeypot, mint, or freeze badges were visible on the top 10.",
    "trending.png figures matched the stored top 10 in the same order: PI / Profession... (56AT…P5TZ) MC $10.6K / +162.2% / holders 134 / vol $125.9K / top10 22% / insider 20% / sniper 0%; Unemployed (FJ3e…pump) $97.5K / +42.9% / 947 / $310.6K / 23% / 40% / 11.47%; Gem / Gem Coin (G5g4…pump) $8.2K / +153.6% / 143 / $44.9K / 13% / 22% / 6.97%; WOLF / The Lone W... (EzKE…b2S4) $15K / +554.1% / 191 / $51.8K / 25% / 37% / 5.65%; PI / Profession... (4vaH…pump) $2.5K / +25.5% / 82 / $73.8K / 10% / 2% / 0%; PAPX / Papxima (43VZ…pump) $7.9K / +246.1% / 140 / $54.5K / 18% / 12% / 0.32%; XDOG (4Zx4…pump) $20K / +531.3% / 171 / $78.8K / 21% / 40% / 0%; Sheep / The Black... (5Z7j…pump) $5.9K / +165.3% / 98 / $48.5K / 26% / 33% / 15.46%; DUVAL / The White... (7fmD…pump) $382.7K / -11.1% / 2.5K / $430.1K / 12% / 16% / 25.6%; newtek / new crypto... (7k83…pump) $18.9K / +840.3% / 153 / $50.5K / 29% / 35% / 3.46%. Some display names were truncated with ... on GMGN and were stored that way. Two different PI / Profession... mints are both in the top 10.",
    "smartFlows are 1h per-wallet Smart Inflow card rows from https://gmgn.ai/monitor?chain=sol&tab=smartdegen (Monitor > Smart, 1h), not the left-rail Smart Degen feed or Smart Net Inflow aggregates. usd is the signed 1h net inflow GMGN displayed; some Sell All/Sell Partial rows are still positive (and a few First Buy rows negative) because that column is 1h net, not the last fill — values were stored as shown, not sign-flipped. 132 distinct rows were captured across 59 token cards and 6 scroll steps; the board may have had more cards beyond that. On later scroll passes, cards whose ticker had already been seen were skipped, so a second B008 LABS, a second ANSEM, and a second ASAMI (same ticker, different mint) may be missing. Three rows used a tiny-subscript scientific amount that could not be parsed confidently, so their usd is null (FoolCoin, daoSOL, POPCAT).",
    "walletFull (complete base58) was recorded only when GMGN exposed it (wallet link href, copy button, hover, or equivalent). None of the 132 card rows exposed a full address in the DOM, so walletFull is omitted on every row. Full addresses were not guessed from abbreviations. Some wallet labels are names rather than prefix…suffix abbreviations. tokenCaAbbrev is included to disambiguate reused tickers.",
    "Accumulation (multiple distinct smart wallets with First Buy and/or Buy More on the same token): CLAUDIO (5St9…pump) (3 wallets); DCTY (9hjB…pump) (3 wallets); Memeployed (4m2P…kqxn) (3 wallets); PUMP (pump…9Dfn) (3 wallets); DRILLPIG (6Awr…pump) (2 wallets); DUVAL (7fmD…pump) (2 wallets); FIONA (B34n…pump) (2 wallets); NICKEH30 (DFKw…idFD) (2 wallets); SPCX (SPCX…imGb) (2 wallets); XDOG (4Zx4…pump) (2 wallets); duh (ngwx…pump) (2 wallets); dump (Bu3h…pump) (2 wallets).",
    "Daily top-15 smart-degen wallet recapture was done in this 8 AM ET first run of the day (asOfET 8:30 AM ET, Nov 24, 2026) from https://gmgn.ai/rank?chain=sol&tab=smart_degen (Smart Money filter, 7D, sorted by 7D PnL descending). 15 full addresses were taken from /sol/address/ hrefs. Labels were not shown (abbreviated addresses only). Tags appeared only as icons, not readable text, so tags are empty arrays. 30D PnL was not shown on the 7D view (null). lastActive was visible and stored.",
